---
import '../styles/global.css';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
---

<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.loli.net" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://gstatic.loli.net" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.loli.net/css2?family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <title>Linked Power</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Linked Power 提供 PM8000 电能质量监测与能源管理解决方案，支持电能数据采集、质量分析与智能诊断。"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-white text-slate-900 antialiased">
    <SiteHeader />

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-16">
      <section id="about" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-8">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:items-start">
            <div>
              <h2 class="mb-2 max-w-[20ch] text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
                我们交付的不只是监测数据，而是可衡量的能源管理价值
              </h2>
              <p class="max-w-[64ch] text-[1.04rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 p-5"">
                依托 PM8000 电能质量监测仪，将配电系统数据、能耗趋势与异常情况实时转化为可执行的运营洞察，帮助企业提升供电可靠性、降低能源成本并推动智能运维升级。
              </p>

              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 p-5">
                <a
                  class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-brand-red px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-red-dark"
                  href="#contact"
                >
                  预约咨询
                </a>
                <a
                  class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-300 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 transition-colors hover:border-brand-red hover:text-brand-red"
                  href="#products"
                >
                  查看产品
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-xl p-4">
              <video
                controls
                autoplay
                muted
                loop
                playsinline
                preload="metadata"
                class="w-full rounded-lg bg-black"
              >
                <source src="/hero.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
                您的浏览器不支持视频播放。
              </video>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3 p-5">
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3">
              <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">电能数据覆盖</span>
              <strong class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">100%</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3">
              <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">异常定位效率</span>
              <strong class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">2x</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3">
              <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">能源洞察实时性</span>
              <strong class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">实时</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="products" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-8">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-red">产品系列</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">核心产品：PM8000 电能质量监测仪</h2>
        </div>

        <article class="grid gap-6 bg-white p-5 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr]">
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">PM8000 电能质量监测仪</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              面向关键配电系统与高耗能生产环境，PM8000 提供从设备级数据采集到系统级质量分析的一体化监测能力，帮助企业建立可追溯、可优化的能源管理闭环。
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-slate-600">
              <li>覆盖电压、电流、频率、谐波等关键参数，提升能源使用透明度</li>
              <li>实时识别电压波动、谐波风险与异常工况，快速定位潜在隐患</li>
              <li>开放式通信接口，便于与能源管理系统、SCADA 与运维平台联动</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <figure class="h-70 overflow-hidden p-3">
            <img
              src="/pl8000.jpg"
              alt="PM8000 电能质量监测仪"
              class="h-full w-full object-contain"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </figure>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section id="cases" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-8">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-red">案例</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">食品包装产线升级项目（示例）</h2>
        </div>

        <article class="bg-white p-5">
          <p class="text-slate-600">
            某制造企业在多条生产线并联运行时，持续出现电压波动与谐波扰动，影响设备稳定性与能耗管理。通过 PM8000 的实时监测与诊断能力，客户实现了异常定位效率提升和能效管理的可视化。
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3">
              <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">异常定位时间</span>
              <strong class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">-45%</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3">
              <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">电能质量风险识别</span>
              <strong class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">+30%</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3">
              <span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">能耗管理透明度</span>
              <strong class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">显著提升</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section id="downloads" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-8">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-red">资料下载</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">产品与技术资料</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-3 p-5">
          <a
            href="#"
            class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 transition-colors hover:border-brand-red md:flex-row"
          >
            <strong class="text-slate-900">PM8000 产品手册（PDF）</strong>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">版本 2026.07 · 12MB</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#"
            class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 transition-colors hover:border-brand-red md:flex-row"
          >
            <strong class="text-slate-900">电能质量诊断与应用白皮书（PDF）</strong>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">版本 2026.04 · 8MB</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#"
            class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 transition-colors hover:border-brand-red md:flex-row"
          >
            <strong class="text-slate-900">系统接入与部署指南（PDF）</strong>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">版本 2026.06 · 15MB</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-8">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-red">联系我们</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
            从配电需求到能源优化，<br />我们为您提供专业技术支持与解决方案
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-6 rounded-lg bg-white p-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="space-y-2 text-slate-700">
            <p><strong>销售咨询：</strong>+86 0513-88888888</p>
            <p><strong>技术支持：</strong>+86 0513-88888999</p>
            <p><strong>邮箱：</strong>contact@linked-power.com</p>
            <p><strong>地址：</strong>上海市临港南桥科技城 29栋 505 室</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="scroll-mt-24 pt-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-500">
        <p>© 2026 Linked Power. All Rights Reserved.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
